(A significant learning moment was understanding how to use HardwareSerial \(Serial1/Serial2\) on the ESP32) Tj
T* (and Pico to communicate between devices while reserving the main 'Serial' bus for PC debugging. Verifying) Tj
T* (that the logic level voltages \(3.3V\) were compatible between the ESP32 and the Pico was also a critical step) Tj
T* (before making the physical connections.) Tj
